\newlabel{fig:res-judges}{{40}{124}{Character accuracy of the synthesised text under the production recogniser and under a recogniser checkpoint that was not used to select the candidates. The independent judge scores the same output about three points lower, which quantifies how much of the apparent quality is a selection effect and simultaneously shows that the synthesis is genuinely legible rather than merely self-consistent}{figure.caption.113}{}}
