\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {42}{\ignorespaces Writer-identification accuracy per writer over 1358 real lines, for the ink classifier and for the shape classifier before and after its training fault was corrected. The ink classifier is at or near 100\% for every writer. Correcting the shape classifier's training raised its overall accuracy from 83.4\% to 93.7\% and removed a systematic collapse in which 118 of Owen's 148 lines had been assigned to Yeukita. The dashed line is the 95\% target of R2.}}{126}{figure.caption.117}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:res-writerid}{{42}{126}{Writer-identification accuracy per writer over 1358 real lines, for the ink classifier and for the shape classifier before and after its training fault was corrected. The ink classifier is at or near 100\% for every writer. Correcting the shape classifier's training raised its overall accuracy from 83.4\% to 93.7\% and removed a systematic collapse in which 118 of Owen's 148 lines had been assigned to Yeukita. The dashed line is the 95\% target of R2}{figure.caption.117}{}}
